# ============================================================
# Go Orbit - Real Email & SMTP Configuration
# ============================================================
#
# Option A: Resend API (Recommended & Fastest Setup)
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com
# 2. Generate an API Key under "API Keys"
# 3. Paste it below:
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
RESEND_FROM=Go Orbit Security <onboarding@resend.dev>

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Option B: Gmail SMTP
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification in your Google Account
# 2. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an "App Password" (name it "Go Orbit")
# 4. Copy the generated 16-character password below:
# SMTP_SERVICE=gmail
# SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# EMAIL_FROM="Go Orbit Security" <your-email@gmail.com>

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Option C: Custom SMTP Server (Mailgun, SendGrid, Amazon SES, Brevo)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.your-provider.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your-smtp-username
# SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-password
# EMAIL_FROM="Go Orbit Security" <no-reply@yourdomain.com>
# ============================================================
